SUMMARY:Supreme Court: A petition against deletions in Maharashtra's revisi
 on\, W.P.(C) No. 1330 of 2026. The Court issued notice to the Election Com
 mission on 26 October
DESCRIPTION:A petition against deletions in Maharashtra's revision\, W.P.(C
 ) No. 1330 of 2026. The Court issued notice to the Election Commission on 
 26 October. The petition is listed for hearing. On 26 October the Court de
 clined to extend the time for claims and objections or to stop the final r
 oll before hearing the Commission. Court: Supreme Court. Source: LawChakra
 \, https://lawchakra.in/supreme-court/maharashtra-sir-notice-eci/ More: ht
 tps://offtheroll.in/india/disputes/#d-court-51
